#43201
The deep blue sea~
Further into the depths of the water, it becomes darker and much harder to see.
The water ripples around as if someone is controlling the water itself.  The
Presence of another life form becomes stronger and stronger.  There is no harm
in leaving now...  While you still can.    
~
